# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Exclude build artifacts, VCS, editor cruft, test files, and everything
# not needed to compile the manager binary. Anything not listed below is
# included so Go can see cmd/ and internal/ source trees.
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
bin
dist
testbin
config
docs
hack
test
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/**
